# Boost Order Bot

## Required environment variables

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="<REPLACE_WITH_BOT_TOKEN_FROM_@BotFather>"
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_ANY_RANDOM_32_CHAR_STRING>"
SOLANA_RECEIVING_WALLET="<REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SOLANA_WALLET_ADDRESS>"
SOLANA_RPC_URL="https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com"
BOT_ADMIN_TELEGRAM_IDS="<REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_NUMERIC_ID_FROM_@userinfobot>"
OPENAI_API_KEY="<REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_OPENAI_OR_AI_GATEWAY_KEY>"

## Notes
- The Telegram webhook route is at `/api/public/telegram-webhook`.
- The AI campaign brief route is at `/api/public/campaign-brief`.
- Use the `telegram_updates` table to deduplicate webhook requests.
- Payment verification uses the Solana RPC `getSignaturesForAddress` flow and checks the transfer amount against the configured receiving wallet.
